# Golden binary assets: tracked deliberately under tests/golden/ via git-lfs or
# explicit force-add. NOTE: unlike wheel-rail-lab, ORVD must be able to freeze
# startup snapshots and golden vectors as versioned artifacts (design basis §C),
# so DO NOT blanket-ignore *.npz. Ignore them only outside the golden tree:
*.npz
!tests/golden/**/*.npz
